# Generated by Cargo
debug
target

# rustfmt backups and compiler diagnostics
**/*.rs.bk
rustc-ice-*.txt
*.pdb

# Mutation testing and coverage
**/mutants.out*/
lcov.info

# Python and local validation environments
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
